00:10:06.659 --> 00:10:14.260
So this code right here will then produce this slide that we're seeing right here, where

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:18.919
our first slide, everything is now rendered to HTML.

00:10:18.919 --> 00:10:27.919
We have our code and it's being evaluated and put in how we would expect.

00:10:27.919 --> 00:10:31.440
And there's two ways of really doing this.

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:37.340
