00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:47.280
If you're already in a repo and it's the only thing, or at least if it's Trotter index,

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:52.479
I'm pretty sure you can just do Trotter render, you don't need to specify the name.

00:10:52.479 --> 00:11:01.000
That's also if you're in a studio or Positron and you're in a Trotter document, there should

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:03.559
